    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>RestorArt</i> and <i>Twistingo </i>comes a sun-kissed puzzle escape you won\u2019t want to miss: <strong>Jixo 2: Summer Dreams</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of easygoing summer bliss. From sunny gardens to peaceful patios, each scene bursts with bright colours, calming details, and the simple joy of a beautiful day in full bloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a delightful variety of seasonal games, including captivating hidden-object puzzles full of charming discoveries, inventive jigsaw challenges with a fresh twist, and engaging picture puzzles that celebrate the warmth and wonder of the season\u2014all set to soothing, relaxing music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the mysterious Locked Boxes for a satisfying brain workout - each one hiding a new surprise just waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This special Collector's Edition release is full of exclusive extras you won\u2019t find in the standard version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collector\u2019s Edition Features:<br>\ud83e\udde9 Exclusive Mini-Games \u2013 Enjoy endless crosswords, vibrant Tile Matching, and a unique twist on Solitaire<br>\ud83c\udf38 Garden Paradise \u2013 Complete levels to grow your perfect summer garden<br>\ud83d\udcf7 Stunning Art Gallery \u2013 Bask in the glow of summer with a vivid collection of seasonal artwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're puzzling on the porch or daydreaming by the beach, Jixo 2: Summer Dreams is the perfect companion for a peaceful, sun-filled escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <i>RestorArt</i> and <i>Twistingo </i>comes a sun-kissed puzzle escape you won\u2019t want to miss: <strong>Jixo 2: Summer Dreams</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of easygoing summer bliss. From sunny gardens to peaceful patios, each scene bursts with bright colours, calming details, and the simple joy of a beautiful day in full bloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a delightful variety of seasonal games, including captivating hidden-object puzzles full of charming discoveries, inventive jigsaw challenges with a fresh twist, and engaging picture puzzles that celebrate the warmth and wonder of the season\u2014all set to soothing, relaxing music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the mysterious Locked Boxes for a satisfying brain workout - each one hiding a new surprise just waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This special Collector's Edition release is full of exclusive extras you won\u2019t find in the standard version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collector\u2019s Edition Features:<br>\ud83e\udde9 Exclusive Mini-Games \u2013 Enjoy endless crosswords, vibrant Tile Matching, and a unique twist on Solitaire<br>\ud83c\udf38 Garden Paradise \u2013 Complete levels to grow your perfect summer garden<br>\ud83d\udcf7 Stunning Art Gallery \u2013 Bask in the glow of summer with a vivid collection of seasonal artwork</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're puzzling on the porch or daydreaming by the beach, Jixo 2: Summer Dreams is the perfect companion for a peaceful, sun-filled escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
